+    // the canal lights. Each folds pressure -> loss (steady queue backlog + pulsing
+    // drops) rather than splitting those into separate modes; kept ADJACENT so the two
+    // directions flip back to back. src/index.ts rotates the hot bottleneck through the
+    // three stages, and when it lands on the SOCKET stage the recv-q / send-q OVERFLOW
+    // counter fires too -- so the capacitor-bay reverse FLASHOVER is one of these modes'
+    // randomized targets, not a mode of its own. Appended after the network group, so no
+    // earlier mode renumbers; network is never referenced engine-side.
